### Common Mistake (Debugged Myself)
Initially tried scanning specific ports directly by name (`22,80,443`) instead of an IP/range, which caused a DNS resolution failure:
```
nmap -p 1-65535 -T4 -A -v 22,80,443
Error resolving 22,80,443: N
Failed to resolve "22,80,443"
```

**Fix:** Corrected the target to a proper IP/CIDR range (`192.168.1.0/24`) instead of a port list.

